<?xml version="1.0" encoding="ISO-8859-1"?>
<wps:ProcessDescriptions xmlns:wps="http://www.opengis.net/wps/1.0.0" xmlns:ows="http://www.opengis.net/ows/1.1" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.opengis.net/wps/1.0.0 schemas/wps/1.0.0/wpsDescribeProcess_response.xsd" service="WPS" version="1.0.0" xml:lang="en-US">
	<ProcessDescription wps:processVersion="1" storeSupported="true" statusSupported="false">
		<ows:Identifier>MiraMon:Pendent:1</ows:Identifier>
		<ows:Title>Terrain analysis: slope, orientation, etc</ows:Title>
		<ows:Abstract>This program calculates, based on a Digital Elevation Model, several Digital Models (slope: MDP, orientation: MDO, etc) which are derived from the elevations, in order to describe and to characterize the relief.</ows:Abstract>
		<ows:Metadata xlink:title="Title:Terrain analysis: slope, orientation, etc"/>
		<ows:Metadata xlink:title="Abstract:This program calculates, based on a Digital Elevation Model, several Digital Models (slope: MDP, orientation: MDO, etc) which are derived from the elevations, in ordre to describe and to characterise the relief."/>
		<DataInputs>
			<Input minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1">
				<ows:Identifier>MDE</ows:Identifier>
				<ows:Title>Digital Elevation Model</ows:Title>
				<ows:Abstract>Digital Elevation Model raster file</ows:Abstract>
				<ows:Metadata xlink:title="Param1"/>
				<ows:Metadata xlink:title="Name:DEM"/>
				<ComplexData>
					<Default>
						<Format>
							<MimeType>application/x-img</MimeType>
							<Encoding>Binary</Encoding>
						</Format>
					</Default>
					<Supported>
						<Format>
							<MimeType>application/x-img</MimeType>
							<Encoding>Binary</Encoding>
						</Format>
					</Supported>
				</ComplexData>
			</Input>
			<Input minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1">
				<ows:Identifier>TipusAnalisi</ows:Identifier>
				<ows:Title>Analysis type</ows:Title>
				<ows:Abstract><![CDATA[Option that indicates the choice of analysis to be carried out:<li>1: Slope (°)</li><li>2: Slope (%)</li><li>4: Orientation (° + plane)</li><li>5: 4 orientations</li><li>6: 8 orientations</li><li>7: Curvature</li></ul>]]></ows:Abstract>
				<ows:Metadata xlink:title="Param3"/>
				<ows:Metadata xlink:title="Name:AnalysisType"/>
				<LiteralData>
					<ows:DataType ows:reference="http://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-2/#positiveInteger">positiveInteger</ows:DataType>
					<ows:AllowedValues>
						<ows:Value>1</ows:Value>
						<ows:Value>2</ows:Value>
						<ows:Value>4</ows:Value>
						<ows:Value>6</ows:Value>
						<ows:Value>7</ows:Value>
					</ows:AllowedValues>
					<DefaultValue>1</DefaultValue>
				</LiteralData>
			</Input>
			<Input minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1">
				<ows:Identifier>NombreVeins</ows:Identifier>
				<ows:Title>Neighbors number</ows:Title>
				<ows:Abstract>This parameter can value 4 or 8 depending on the number of neighbors to be used in the calculations related to the central pixel.</ows:Abstract>
				<ows:Metadata xlink:title="Param4"/>
				<ows:Metadata xlink:title="Name:NumberNeighbours"/>
				<LiteralData>
					<ows:DataType ows:reference="http://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-2/#positiveInteger">positiveInteger</ows:DataType>
					<ows:AllowedValues>
						<ows:Value>4</ows:Value>
						<ows:Value>8</ows:Value>
					</ows:AllowedValues>
					<DefaultValue>4</DefaultValue>
				</LiteralData>
			</Input>
			<Input minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="1">
				<ows:Identifier>PEN_PLA</ows:Identifier>
				<ows:Title>Flat slope</ows:Title>
				<ows:Abstract>For calculating orientation, allows the user to indicate the value of the slope below which the area is considered as flat (horizontal) and the orientation of that point undefined. The default value is 2°. To only consider perfectly flat surfaces as having no orientation it is necessary to set this parameter to 0°.</ows:Abstract>
				<LiteralData>
					<ows:DataType ows:reference="http://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-2/#integer">integer</ows:DataType>
					<ows:AnyValue/>
					<DefaultValue>2</DefaultValue>
				</LiteralData>
			</Input>
		</DataInputs>
		<ProcessOutputs>
			<Output>
				<ows:Identifier>FitxerSortida</ows:Identifier>
				<ows:Title>Output</ows:Title>
				<ows:Abstract>Raster file containing the output from the terrain analysis.</ows:Abstract>
				<ows:Metadata xlink:title="Param2"/>
				<ows:Metadata xlink:title="Name:OutputFile"/>
				<ComplexOutput>
					<Default>
						<Format>
							<MimeType>application/x-img</MimeType>
							<Encoding>Binary</Encoding>
						</Format>
					</Default>
					<Supported>
						<Format>
							<MimeType>application/x-img</MimeType>
							<Encoding>Binary</Encoding>
						</Format>
					</Supported>
				</ComplexOutput>
			</Output>
		</ProcessOutputs>
	</ProcessDescription>
</wps:ProcessDescriptions>